  <summary>Morrowind and OpenMW load order, conflicts and cell preview</summary>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <!-- The toolkit is MIT; the viewer's page (viewer-shell/ui) is GPL-2.0, for its
